                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "These files contain the GWAS summary statistics as described in van der Zee, M.D., et al. (2021, manuscript submitted). If summary statistics are used, please make sure to include a reference to the original manuscript."
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
