            "typeClass": "compound",
            "value": [
              {
                "publicationCitation": {
                  "typeName": "publicationCitation",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "van der Zee, M.D., Ehli, E.A., Pool, R., Hottenga, J.J., van der Mee, D.J., Ligthart, L., Bartels, M., van Dongen, J.  & de Geus, E.J.C. (manuscript in preparation). Genome-wide association study of voluntary exercise behaviors in the Netherlands"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "In this directory you can find GWAS summary statistics for total volume of exercise (MET_Total), team-based exercise (MET_Team), solitary exercise (MET_Comp), competitive exercise (MET_Comp), non-competitive exercise (MET_Ncomp), externally paced exercise (MET_PaceE) and internally paced exercise (MET_PaceI). All files are tab-delimited, and gzipped. \r\nAll files include the following columns: \r\n - RSID: persistent rs-identifier of SNP if available, otherwise missing\r\n - Chr: Chromsome number (chromosome 23 represents the X-chromosome), build 37\r\n - bp: basepair position, build 37\r\n - A1: effect allele\r\n - A2: other allele\r\n - EAF: effect allele frequency\r\n - OAF: other allele frequency\r\n - MAF: minor allele frequency\r\n - Info: Imputation quality\r\n - b: Beta\r\n - se: Standard error\r\n - p: Associated p-value\r\n - N: Number of GWAS samples"
          },
          {
            "typeName": "depositor",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "van der Zee, Matthijs D."
          },
